# Batch sweep outputs — every CSV and TeX artifact is regenerable from
# scripts/run_batch_sweep.py + scripts/aggregate_results.py +
# scripts/aggregate_per_locus_for_A.py + scripts/build_manuscript_figures.py +
# scripts/build_stats_tables.py.  None of them are tracked.
#
# What is tracked from supplement/:
#   - supplement/figures_priority/*.pdf            (manuscript figures)
# The LaTeX assemblers (fig1.tex, fig2.tex, fig3.tex, fig4.tex,
# figA.tex) live in the companion nwflex_TNG repo under tex/, next to
# main.tex.  Everything else under supplement/ is gitignored below.
#
# (PNG previews of every figure are already covered by the global
# *.png rule above.)

*.csv
*.tex

supplement/data/single_repeat/
supplement/data/compound/
supplement/figures/
supplement/figures_full/
supplement/figures_full_priority/


